📌 Project Title

**Heart Disease Prediction using Machine Learning**

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🎯 Project Objective

The goal of this project is to build a **classification model** that predicts whether a person has heart disease or not based on medical attributes.

This project demonstrates:

* Data preprocessing
* Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
* Model training
* Model evaluation
* Cross-validation

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🏥 Problem Statement

Heart disease is one of the leading causes of death worldwide.

Using patient health data, we aim to:

* Predict risk early
* Assist doctors in decision-making
* Improve healthcare outcomes

Target Variable:

* `1` → Heart Disease Present
* `0` → No Heart Disease

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

📊 Dataset Description

Common features in the dataset:

* Age
* Sex
* Chest Pain Type
* Resting Blood Pressure
* Cholesterol
* Fasting Blood Sugar
* Rest ECG
* Maximum Heart Rate
* Exercise Induced Angina
* Oldpeak (ST depression)
* Target (Heart Disease)

